    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n45454" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὔφων-ος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>sweet-voiced, musical</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Πιερίδες</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pi.
					<u>I.</u>
					1.64
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χορός</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Ag.</u>
					1187
				</span></i>
			; <i>sweettoned</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λύρα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>Metaph.</u>
					1019b15
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ βαρὺ ἀπὸ τοῦ ὀξέος -ότερον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Pr.</u>
					920a23
